%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Items_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72df8041cb1f65b40958c98981ef1561, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 937747718553469026
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1898613006336
    m_Localized: No Room For Error
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2067794452480
    m_Localized: Deal an absurd amount of damage, but a single hit could be your undoing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70567816814592
    m_Localized: Large Health Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70680580677632
    m_Localized: Restore {health} HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 71017257459712
    m_Localized: Random Teleport
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71319167655936
    m_Localized: Wanna gamble? Teleport to a random spot, even inside the danger zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71503196938240
    m_Localized: Weapon - Machine Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71606984990720
    m_Localized: Weapon with a much higher rate of fire but much lower damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73022222852096
    m_Localized: Kill or die. There's no room for error...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74540846112768
    m_Localized: Flee with a lil twist. Random, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75199460892672
    m_Localized: This weapon fires fast ASF.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75812378730496
    m_Localized: Uncommon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75907253886976
    m_Localized: Rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75961305882624
    m_Localized: Epic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76011700445184
    m_Localized: Unstable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76081032290304
    m_Localized: Legendary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24637296295239680
    m_Localized: Missing Texture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24637799422976000
    m_Localized: They can't see you, you can't see them. If you already have this item, you go missing yourself... At least you'll gain speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24638048178757632
    m_Localized: Now no one can see you, neither can you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24638443533852672
    m_Localized: (Un)lucky Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24639211494137856
    m_Localized: One random player among all players including you gets unlucky and takes {damage} damage out of the blue. The player is left with 1 HP if the damage would be lethal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 24639686226436096
    m_Localized: One got unlucky and took damage, all 'cause of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24646271011086336
    m_Localized: Twin Barrel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24646440532271104
    m_Localized: Weapon that fires 2 exploding projectiles. Ideal for small distances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24647016879972352
    m_Localized: Get a big gun, big damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25105894847504384
    m_Localized: Small Health Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25106182220242944
    m_Localized: Restore {health} HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 25157885992853504
    m_Localized: Jar O' Gunpowder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158317096001536
    m_Localized: Deal more damage, more gunpowder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158649037414400
    m_Localized: Heavy Treads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158904093040640
    m_Localized: Become heavier but more protected. Heavier doesn't mean fatter, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25362945230200832
    m_Localized: Rapid Loader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25372714284310528
    m_Localized: Beeswax Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25372870668935168
    m_Localized: Temporary gain enough defense and speed to demolish everyone on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25373363868753920
    m_Localized: Gain enough defense and speed to destroy everyone. It all begins now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25751314284109824
    m_Localized: Bloodlust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25751396253392896
    m_Localized: For each {interval} missing HP, you gain {damage} damage. But this item may be picked up only once, otherwise you'll die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 25753328636354560
    m_Localized: Deal more damage as you lose HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26193936811253760
    m_Localized: Bomb Launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26194437552431104
    m_Localized: Weapon that fires a bomb. On any impact the bomb detonates launching a ton of shards from the explosion. Each shard deals small damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26196113726332928
    m_Localized: Fire once, but any collision will cause an explosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26441192122572800
    m_Localized: Freezing Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26441382044852224
    m_Localized: This weapon doesn't deal damage. The player you hit receives the {effect-frozen} status effect for a couple seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 26442908607930368
    m_Localized: Deal no damage, but freeze whoever you hit one time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26924141402087424
    m_Localized: True Balance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26924559217680384
    m_Localized: Every time you fire a weapon, every player but you gains {heal} HP. Players that have this item are not affected. Your rate of fire is doubled, make sure you deal more damage than you miss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 26926915934183424
    m_Localized: Others heal as you fire, but you fire faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27916745065324544
    m_Localized: You restored a large amount of HP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27916975806570496
    m_Localized: You restored a little HP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27918120339857408
    m_Localized: 'Fire weapons a lil'' faster. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27924629891276800
    m_Localized: You picked up {item}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 27924629891276801
    m_Localized: picked up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328096747520
    m_Localized: Pillow Protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690560
    m_Localized: Not an airbag, but still useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690561
    m_Localized: Slightly gain defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690562
    m_Localized: Slippery Soap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690563
    m_Localized: Trust me, you will feel the effect when you drive forward and shoot backwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690564
    m_Localized: Gain speed but lose resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690565
    m_Localized: Rusty Part
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690566
    m_Localized: Despite its rust, you will deal more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690567
    m_Localized: Deal slightly more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690571
    m_Localized: Burst of Adrenaline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690572
    m_Localized: When below {health-threshold} HP, gain speed and rate of fire for {duration} seconds. Works only once per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34421328138690573
    m_Localized: Flee or fight on the verge of death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690574
    m_Localized: Re-ReRoll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690575
    m_Localized: This thing shuffles your stats every {interval} seconds. Stats with a value of zero are ignored and not affected. Some stats might hit their cap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34421328138690576
    m_Localized: Now your stats have a life on their own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604776202240
    m_Localized: Stats Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339584
    m_Localized: Every {interval} seconds, your stats increase one by one. Only one stat can be affected at a time, previous stats get back to normal. Once it passes the last stat, the cycle repeats from the first stat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34446604822339585
    m_Localized: Even stats tailor for the traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339586
    m_Localized: DNA Reconstruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339587
    m_Localized: 'Boosts one random stat and weakens another.


      Damage, speed and rate of fire: {damage-boost} / {damage-penalty}.

      Defense: +{defense-boost} / {defense-penalty}.

      Resistance: +{resistance-boost} / {resistance-penalty}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34446604822339588
    m_Localized: Evolution comes at a price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35240567506427904
    m_Localized: Supplies In The Fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35240567560953856
    m_Localized: Whenever you gain any HP, your lowest stat gains {increase}, and your highest gains {decrease}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35240567560953857
    m_Localized: Two for the price of one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35299638754369538
    m_Localized: MAX lvl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35299638754369539
    m_Localized: All your stats are maxed for {duration} seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35299638754369540
    m_Localized: Yes, this is totally legal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35315045817081856
    m_Localized: Lucky Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35315045817081857
    m_Localized: Each third hit from you deals {damage} more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35315045817081858
    m_Localized: Deal more damage on each third hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35493227904065536
    m_Localized: Thorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35493227946008576
    m_Localized: Whenever you take damage, {damage} of the damage is reflected to the one who decided to mess with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35493227946008577
    m_Localized: Even this game has commission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35493227946008578
    m_Localized: Negative Speed Limit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35493227946008579
    m_Localized: Take {damage} damage whenever you drive forward, but self damage is reduced by {decrease}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35493227946008580
    m_Localized: Backwards tech - Best tech.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35508022451593216
    m_Localized: Chicken Egg
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35508022451593217
    m_Localized: Deal {damage} more damage if the hit player has {threshold} HP or more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35508022451593218
    m_Localized: Better not miss the first one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35511987285221376
    m_Localized: Self-Conscious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35511987289415680
    m_Localized: You fire unbelievably fast, but self damage is increased by {damage}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 35511987289415681
    m_Localized: There is still a right for mistakes, still...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000000
    m_Localized: Girl's Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000001
    m_Localized: Contains everything you need. Increases all your stats except Speed by {increase}, but decreases your Speed by {decrease}. Because it's heavy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000002
    m_Localized: Packed for anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000003
    m_Localized: Chilling Couch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000004
    m_Localized: Every {interval} seconds of staying still, you increase your highest stat by {increase}. If the highest stat is at its limit, it increases the next highest stat. Moving or turning your tank resets the timer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000005
    m_Localized: Sit and relax, make a cup of tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000006
    m_Localized: Noclip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000007
    m_Localized: Pass through walls for {duration} seconds. During the effect you can't shoot, but you can still take damage. If you are inside a wall when the effect runs out, you'll be instantly eliminated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000008
    m_Localized: Pass through walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000009
    m_Localized: Like a Diamond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000010
    m_Localized: Shine dazzlingly bright, it exposes you to the other players. Nevertheless you know how to deal with them with these stats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000011
    m_Localized: Impossible to overlook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000012
    m_Localized: Flattering Flower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000013
    m_Localized: Shows a sign of kindness and gives every player the {effect-healing} status effect for {duration} seconds including you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000014
    m_Localized: Peace was an option.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000015
    m_Localized: No Honor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000016
    m_Localized: Deal {increase} more damage when you land a shot on a player's back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000017
    m_Localized: Watch your back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000018
    m_Localized: Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000019
    m_Localized: Launches a giant fireball. Any impact causes a massive explosion dealing a ton of damage. Players near the explosion receive the {effect-burning} status effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000020
    m_Localized: Things are about to heat up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000021
    m_Localized: Freebie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000022
    m_Localized: This weapon deals no damage. On impact it spawns a random item of a random tier except Uncommon and Legendary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000023
    m_Localized: Everything must go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000024
    m_Localized: Ignited Balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000025
    m_Localized: This weapon fires tiny balls that cause the {effect-burning} status effect on impact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000026
    m_Localized: Small but spicy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000027
    m_Localized: Hibernation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000028
    m_Localized: Triggers the {effect-frozen} status effect for {duration} seconds. After, you will be fully healed. Thawing early cancels the healing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000029
    m_Localized: Sleep it off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000030
    m_Localized: Diminishing Returns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000031
    m_Localized: Shooting when above {threshold} HP causes the {effect-burning} status effect for {duration} seconds. Every second direct hit you land on another player deals {increase} more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000032
    m_Localized: Pain pays dividends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000033
    m_Localized: Retrofier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36000000000000034
    m_Localized: 'Lose FPS while massively increasing a stat. You may only pick up this item twice.


      First time: {first} Defense, capped at 20 FPS.

      Second time: {second} Damage, capped at 15 FPS.

      Third time: you die.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 36000000000000035
    m_Localized: Have you ever seen this in games?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38550435874512896
    m_Localized: Flash Grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38550435912261632
    m_Localized: A weapon that fires a flash grenade. On any impact, nearby players including yourself receive the {effect-flashed} status effect. The grenade cannot deal damage or flash players hiding behind obstacles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38550435912261633
    m_Localized: Just don't blind yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 937747718553469026
      type: {class: SmartFormatTag, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
